WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.740
Did the track warn twenty-two hours earlier?

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.452
According to a Guardia Civil report that Adif disputes, the track circuit logged a voltage drop.

3
00:00:09.802 --> 00:00:12.554
No alarm fired: it stayed above the threshold.

4
00:00:12.904 --> 00:00:17.640
SENDA compares each circuit with its own history and catches the step within half an hour.

5
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.605
The official investigation will decide. Meanwhile, the data already exists.
